    - characterName: Placa #2
      characterImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dfec1e70fb323f429c560f9b67f7d53, type: 3}
      dialogueText: 'Jaz aqui: <color=#0BA>Poggers.'
  - flag: 2
    dialogueLines:
    - characterName: 
      characterImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dfec1e70fb323f429c560f9b67f7d53, type: 3}
      dialogueText: "Aquele que est\xE1 no topo, sempre \xE9 o n\xFAmero 1 e todos
        se adaptam a ele. N\xE3o mude a ordem natural das coisas."
  - flag: 3
    dialogueLines:
    - characterName: 
      characterImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dfec1e70fb323f429c560f9b67f7d53, type: 3}
      dialogueText: "O que vc t\xE1 fazendo aqui? Tem nada pra mexer aqui do\xEDdo."
